// Copy this file to SigningOverride.xcconfig and fill in your Team ID.
// SigningOverride.xcconfig is gitignored and will not be committed; Config/Debug.xcconfig
// includes it optionally, so leaving it out changes nothing.
//
// Why bother: a Debug build is signed ad-hoc, which carries no team identity. macOS
// then cannot tell that the app group in its entitlements (ZJ2TSMMJWF.…) belongs to
// the same team, and asks "MacPacker would like to access data from other apps" the
// first time the engine settings are read. Signing with your own development identity
// settles the question and the prompt stops.

DEVELOPMENT_TEAM = YOUR_TEAM_ID_HERE
CODE_SIGN_IDENTITY = Apple Development
